Perhaps this is unimportant to modern life, but it's an interesting tidbit for researchers trying to find what encourages intelligence in the Astra. Among the transformed, the [[pug people]] are perhaps the most recognisable — stocky, broad-faced folk whose canine features sparked no small amount of philosophical hand-wringing about what, exactly, magic considers an improvement.
